        },
        "text_F88jjm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Choosing the right breast pump depends on your lifestyle, comfort, and feeding goals. Whether you’re exclusively pumping, returning to work, or building a freezer stash, Ameda offers a range of pumps to match your needs. From the powerful <strong>Ameda Platinum</strong> hospital-grade pump to the portable <strong>Mya Joy or Mya Joy Plus</strong> and hands-free <strong>GLO Wearable Pump</strong>, Ameda supports you at every stage.</p><p>Need help deciding? Our team is here to guide you. Let us help you find the right pump, so you can focus on what matters most—your baby and your well-being.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "button_LkGQAk": {
